From: Anirudh Srinivasan <asrinivasan@oss.tenstorrent.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 18:35:04 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 04/11] hw/ufs: Add Spacemit K3 UFS controller

Implement a UFS controller for Spacemit K3 that is built on top of the
existing sysbus-ufs controller. The K3 has a standard UFS controller
with a vendor region with PHY registers overlayed at 0x1b00 within the
sysbus-ufs device's standard register region.

Signed-off-by: Anirudh Srinivasan <asrinivasan@oss.tenstorrent.com>

Upstream-Status: Submitted [https://lore.kernel.org/qemu-riscv/20261124-spacemit_k3-v1-2-e911d6e88542@oss.tenstorrent.com/]

[tgamblin: taken from the v2 work in progress at
 https://github.com/asrinivasanTT/qemu/commit/d38cfc216d472e7a9db5ef0fb4c7cd769482ef45]
Signed-off-by: Trevor Gamblin <tgamblin@baylibre.com>
